  },
  {
    kind: "neural",
    name: "Read",
    body: "Your documents go to a language model, which proposes candidate rules from prose. The only step that reads English."
  },
  {
    kind: "symbolic",
    name: "Ground and compile",
    body: "A proposed rule that names a class or package your code does not contain is dropped. The rest become formulas over the model."
  },
  {
    kind: "symbolic",
    name: "Evaluate",
    body: "Each formula is checked against the model of the code before and after the change. A rule is held when nothing in the pull request breaks it, and only a violation the change introduced is attributed to it."
